Put a screenshot of the Overview page here, named dashboard.png.

Both READMEs reference docs/dashboard.png. 1600px wide or so is plenty; the
dark theme photographs well against a light GitHub page.

Before taking it: the access token is printed in the header of the console, not
the page, so it will not appear. The server name and subscription URL will —
crop or blur them if the provider is not one you want to advertise.
